# obsidian-plugin/main.js is deliberately NOT ignored. It is a build artifact,
# but it is also the file you copy into a vault - committing it means installing
# the plugin needs a git pull and nothing else, no Node toolchain on the machine
# holding the vault. CI rebuilds it, so a stale commit shows up as a diff.
